    <nodes>
      <node id="Citalopram" label="Citalopram">
        <attvalues>
          <attvalue for="0" value="medication" />
          <attvalue for="1" value="179" />
          <attvalue for="2" value="[{&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Sedação&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;Von dem Opi hatte ich mehrere, dann noch drei andere Sachen, bis die in der Klinik (#HasiInKlapsi), vor zwei Jahren, festgestellt hatten, dass ich auf Citalopram sehr gut reagiere. Hatte über'n Winter eine höhere Dosis, die hatte mich aber total weggeschüsselt…&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Dependência física&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;The right meds can help but it takes time to find one that works. I went through 5 different antidepressants before landing on citalopram which works for me. It’s not ideal to be dependent on meds, but since it’s not feasible to treat the cause we’re stuck treating the symptoms.&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Labilidade emocional&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;I came off citalopram 8 months ago and now I cry whenever I see Celine Dion I think I am losing my mind.&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Sensação de confusão mental&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;I came off citalopram 8 months ago and now I cry whenever I see Celine Dion I think I am losing my mind.&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Toxicidade&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;Neighbor Lady | Dexter's Laboratory by citalopram-overdose&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Esquecimento&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;I think citalopram is making me forgetful. I try and remember what I did this morning and it’s like my brain has wiped the existence of it from memory.&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Comprometimento cognitivo&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;A study published in BMC Medicine finds that use of antidepressants, particularly selective serotonin reuptake inhibitors (citalopram, sertraline and escitalopram) and mirtazapine, is associated with faster cognitive decline in patients with dementia.\n\n#MedSky #alzsky #PsychSciSky\n&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Síndrome de abstinência&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;I skipped my morning meds because I accidentally took them last night, and i DO feel a bit funny but also we've been doing a lot of cleaning so idk if it's *slight* citalopram withdrawal \n\nWondering if I should take HALF of tomorrow morning's pill now to see if that helps as I'm going out tonight!&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Sonolência&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;I’m also on 80mg of beta blockers to try and stop the migraines AND 40mg of citalopram for my wonky brain so I think everything just works together and makes me sleep&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Desidratação&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;They reckon we're in for a warm spell of weather so it's probably a good time to remind those of Depression medications Sertaline/Citalopram/Fluoxetine/Mirtazipine or any other SRRI 💊 to keep their fluids up\n\nTo stop you from becoming dehydrated or overheating\n\nIt could save a life&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Intolerância ao calor&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;Alt-text because I care about people:\n\nALERT!!\n\nAnti-depressants during hot weather\n\nIf you are taking Sertraline, Citalopram, Duloxetine, Fluoxetin, Mirtazipine\nOR\nany other SNRI/SRRI you are more prone to overheating or dehydration\n\nPlease stay safe in this heat! (continued in reply)&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Desidratação&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;Alt-text because I care about people:\n\nALERT!!\n\nAnti-depressants during hot weather\n\nIf you are taking Sertraline, Citalopram, Duloxetine, Fluoxetin, Mirtazipine\nOR\nany other SNRI/SRRI you are more prone to overheating or dehydration\n\nPlease stay safe in this heat! (continued in reply)&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Desidratação&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;If u take any of these medications please be cautious in the heat.\n\n#dehydration #heat #antidepressants #HotWeather #sertraline #citalopram #Duloxetine #fluoxetine #mirtzapine #snri #srri #hydrated #StayHydrated #medication #health&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Mal-estar&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;Being on Citalopram in this heat is genuinely killing me 🥵&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Mania&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;No por favor, que para llegar al episodio maníaco me falta un montón y eso quiere decir que para dejar el Citalopram me falta más todavía.&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Alteração do apetite&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;Breastfeeding considerations:\n\n• Low-risk: Sertraline, nortriptyline, imipramine\n• Higher milk transfer: Fluoxetine, citalopram\n• Monitor infant for feeding/sedation issues\n• Use LactMed or trusted guidelines&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Sedação&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;Breastfeeding considerations:\n\n• Low-risk: Sertraline, nortriptyline, imipramine\n• Higher milk transfer: Fluoxetine, citalopram\n• Monitor infant for feeding/sedation issues\n• Use LactMed or trusted guidelines&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Sensação de calor&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;Do you take any SSRIs like citalopram? Long-term use of SSRIs makes you more sensitive to hot weather, and for some reason, it particularly manifests at wrists and ankles.&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Agravamento da asma&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;My asthma seem worse on citalopram. Has anyone else experienced this?&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Dispneia&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;takin all of these at once to trigger a hard reset of my brain and be normal finally\n\nin all seriousness fuck citalopram for making me not able to breathe sertraline DONT LET ME DOWN BABY&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Insônia&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;I was feeling a lot better at the weekend but today I feel like my mood has slipped again.\n\nWeek 8 on 20mg citalopram. These just aren’t hitting me the way I want them to, I think they’re not quite strong enough for me tbh.\n\nI still wake up just before 6am no matter what time I go to bed.&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Comprometimento cognitivo&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;I... have to be in a very specific mood for it. Very enjoyed it whilst on a suspension of studies as an undergrad at Sheffield - starting citalopram scrambled my brain, so the aerial shots of Sheffield  in the breaks were consistently met with \&quot;I've been there!\&quot;&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Náusea&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;Anyone else on citalopram get an intense wave of nausea like half an hour after taking it? I've been on it for years and still get this&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Diarreia&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;I've been tempted to go back on the citalopram lately because of various things, but honestly the prospect of NOT being able to do this does put me off. Cleans out the pipes.&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Sensações estranhas&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;Still here.\n\n#citalopram has me feeling quite weird. Numb. It’s improved some things but I’m still dead inside.\n\nAnyway, ADHD is also  kicking my ass today and hindering study. I’m incredibly skittish.\n\nBut. Here’s a recycled one of my butt and thighs for #thighthursday&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Embotamento emocional&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;Still here.\n\n#citalopram has me feeling quite weird. Numb. It’s improved some things but I’m still dead inside.\n\nAnyway, ADHD is also  kicking my ass today and hindering study. I’m incredibly skittish.\n\nBut. Here’s a recycled one of my butt and thighs for #thighthursday&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Síndrome de abstinência&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;Oh, man. Getting off Citalopram was one of the hardest things I have ever done&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Síndrome de abstinência&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;Most effective thing was citalopram and that’s a whole other story getting off it&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Comprometimento cognitivo&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;A study published in BMC Medicine finds that use of antidepressants, particularly selective serotonin reuptake inhibitors (citalopram, sertraline and escitalopram) and mirtazapine, is associated with faster cognitive decline in patients with dementia.\n\n#MedSky #alzsky #PsychSciSky\n&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Orgasmo retardado&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;Mood.\n\nTakes me twice as much effort to cum these days (citalopram)&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Sudorese&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;Citalopram ist zum ausschleichen so Scheiße. Hab 1 Monat nur geschwitzt&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Alterações do sono&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;So I've been on citalopram for 5 months, 20mg for the first 4 and 30mg for the last month.\n\nI don't think it's helping A LOT but one interesting thing is that, for the last 12.5 years basically 9/10 dreams involve working at target in some capacity, for the last couple months it's been like 1/10.&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Embotamento emocional&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;try 40mg of Citalopram! I cannot cry at all, which is somehow worse!&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Náusea&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;Ugh, took my citalopram on an empty stomach now Im nauseated.  Fucking anxiety.&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Choque cerebral&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;If it’s anything like it was with me and citalopram it was p unpleasant. Brain zaps and grumps 😓&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Irritabilidade&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;If it’s anything like it was with me and citalopram it was p unpleasant. Brain zaps and grumps 😓&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Reação adversa&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;I'm definitely somewhere on the ace spectrum, but citalopram has once again hit me like a truck. Somehow I forget, every time I go on it.&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Piora dos sintomas de TDAH&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;I looked up Citalopram after reading your message (I've got Autism and ADHD so got curious). Citalopram is an anti-depressant. From what I could read it could exasperate the ADHD symptoms. So from that I'd think that it's 3 separate ones. :)&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Comprometimento cognitivo&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;A study published in BMC Medicine finds that use of antidepressants, particularly selective serotonin reuptake inhibitors (citalopram, sertraline and escitalopram) and mirtazapine, is associated with faster cognitive decline in patients with dementia.\n\n#MedSky #alzsky #PsychSciSky\n&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Síndrome de abstinência&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;Mum's been on citalopram (an SSRI antidepressant) for 10 years. All previous attempts to wean her off it have destabilised her. And stopping it suddenly can cause withdrawal, dizziness, confusion and falls. \n\nI'll check with the doctor, says the nurse.\nA while later she returns.&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Tontura&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;Mum's been on citalopram (an SSRI antidepressant) for 10 years. All previous attempts to wean her off it have destabilised her. And stopping it suddenly can cause withdrawal, dizziness, confusion and falls. \n\nI'll check with the doctor, says the nurse.\nA while later she returns.&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Confusão&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;Mum's been on citalopram (an SSRI antidepressant) for 10 years. All previous attempts to wean her off it have destabilised her. And stopping it suddenly can cause withdrawal, dizziness, confusion and falls. \n\nI'll check with the doctor, says the nurse.\nA while later she returns.&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Embotamento emocional&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;ich hab ca. 10 jahre Citalopram genommen,wegen Depression. hatte ne Terapie beim pzychoterapeuten, klinik und dann ne analyse. seid 6 Monaten ADHS Diagnose. meine alte Therapeutin hält das für ne Modekrankheit.Mit medis ist es jetzt ganz anders:Gefühle sind nicht so stark mehr antrieb. Alles besser&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Ganho de peso&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;Bei Escitalopram /Citalopram muss man aufs Gewicht achten. Starke Gewichtszunahme innerhalb eines Jahres rechtfertigt Umsetzung auf anderes Präparat.&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Arritmia&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;I've tried quite a few at this point :( majority of SSRI has given me serotonin syndrome symptoms so i've had to stop. and citalopram gave me irregular heartbeat :( so im running out of options.&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Alterações do sono&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;That really would suck. Sorry to hear it.\nIt's an SSRI. Maybe try a different one? I'm on citalopram 20mg and I don't remember my dreams often. When I do, they aren't trippy just normal.&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Embotamento emocional&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;Day 6 of #citalopram…\n\nI’m numb to everything…\n\nDon’t feel like I want to “check out” anymore but also don’t care that I’m here. \n\nBut hey, at least the tablets haven’t killed this thing off…. Right?&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Disfunção sexual&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;He's been on Citalopram for a while now, bustin' just isn't possible at the moment but aside from that he's feeling OK.&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Sensação de confusão mental&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;Currently being wombo combo’ed by citalopram and marvelon we’ve surpassed brain fog it’s straight up silent hill in there&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Eventos Cardiovasculares&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;Drugs to avoid in the name of better patient care according to Prescrire - 2025 uptdate includes #SSRI citalopram, escitalopram and venlafaxine because of risk of cardiovascular events, including QT interval prolongation english.prescrire.org/en/1256/3059... #Medsky #Psysky&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Prolongamento do intervalo QT&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;Drugs to avoid in the name of better patient care according to Prescrire - 2025 uptdate includes #SSRI citalopram, escitalopram and venlafaxine because of risk of cardiovascular events, including QT interval prolongation english.prescrire.org/en/1256/3059... #Medsky #Psysky&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Mal-estar&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;Trying to wean myself off the citalopram and I'm feeling rough and needy 🥲&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Labilidade emocional&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;Trying to wean myself off the citalopram and I'm feeling rough and needy 🥲&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Perda de peso&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;I changed venlaflaxine to Citalopram (this is like the last anti-depressant to try, I've been through them all)\n\nAnd I feel a lot lighter, as in, my weight seems to be heading back to before I started. Also I am able to make myself go for a walk or gym. \n\nMy ptsd anxiety is hanging around still&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Pesadelos&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;citalopram, os piores sonhos te perseguirão para sempre&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Risco de osteoporose&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;🧠 Do commonly prescribed SSRIs—sertraline, citalopram, and escitalopram—affect osteoporosis risk? 🦴 \nThis large-scale target trial emulation using real-world data set out to answer that question⬇️&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Pensamentos suicidas&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;still thinking about this a lot. particularly the candour with which he talks about his suicidal thoughts, how suddenly and insanely they come into your head. also im on the same antidepressant (citalopram) and experienced a similarly miraculous change in mindset on it&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Comprometimento cognitivo&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;A study published in BMC Medicine finds that use of antidepressants, particularly selective serotonin reuptake inhibitors (citalopram, sertraline and escitalopram) and mirtazapine, is associated with faster cognitive decline in patients with dementia.\n\n#MedSky #alzsky #PsychSciSky\n&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Insônia&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;Kann dazu jetzt nur anekdotisch beitragen, aber ich konnte nach zwei Jahren Citalopram plötzlich kaum noch schlafen und hab’s dann nach zwei Monaten Qual ausgeschlichen.&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Taquicardia&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;Zu schnell gelesen 😂\nCitalopram vertrag ich überhaupt nicht, davon bekomme ich Herzrasen und Restless Legs. Das einzige, was gewirt hat, war Trittico, aber davon bekomme ich jetzt heftige Hautausschläge🤷‍♂️&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Inquietação&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;Zu schnell gelesen 😂\nCitalopram vertrag ich überhaupt nicht, davon bekomme ich Herzrasen und Restless Legs. Das einzige, was gewirt hat, war Trittico, aber davon bekomme ich jetzt heftige Hautausschläge🤷‍♂️&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Insônia&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;Citalopram… please just let me sleep normally.&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Hipocalemia&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;Day 6: Most ‘severe’ drug-drug interactions relate to hypokalaemia e.g aripiprazole, citalopram or risk of renal failure e.g NSAIDs. #metolazone can also increase the concentration of lithium. Many DDIs also increase risk of hypotension e.g alcohol, other antihypertensives \n(NOT exhaustive)&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Sonhos bizarros&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;It depends on the medication, but I've had some weird experiences with having bizarre dreams when I first got on my first antidepressant years ago (citalopram)\n\nIt went away after a while though, I think it was just a matter of my body adjusting to it.&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Toxicidade&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;Citalopram (Celexa), Venlafaxine (Effexor), and Duloxetine (Cymbalta).\n\nIt could cause an OD, amongst other complications!&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Fadiga&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;He tenido resacas con menos fatiga mañanera de la que me da el citalopram&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Síndrome de abstinência&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;Irritatingly (given how hard it was to come off it), I think I might have to go back on the citalopram. The ol' panic disorder is really flaring up and my body is... very unpleasant to be in!!!&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Sensações estranhas&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;Citalopram, for me, had a side effect that it is literally impossible to describe, wherein it would make my eardrums occasionally whoosh like I was yawning. It was... weirdly a deeply comforting sensation?&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Pesadelos&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;Citalopram dreams have been a bit weird.\n\nI dreamt last night that I confronted Elon Musk about the state of Twitter and its moderation. He responded to me exactly how I’d expect him to with memeful rhetoric then for some weird reason he just disappeared out of thin air.\n\nWtf brain.&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Sensações estranhas&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;I've had a couple of periods on Citalopram due to anxiety and depression. I didn't suffer terribly from side effects aside from a bit of scalp creep, slight increase in sweating, and excessive yawning. Everything settled after a couple of weeks.&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Sudorese&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;I've had a couple of periods on Citalopram due to anxiety and depression. I didn't suffer terribly from side effects aside from a bit of scalp creep, slight increase in sweating, and excessive yawning. Everything settled after a couple of weeks.&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Bocejo excessivo&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;I've had a couple of periods on Citalopram due to anxiety and depression. I didn't suffer terribly from side effects aside from a bit of scalp creep, slight increase in sweating, and excessive yawning. Everything settled after a couple of weeks.&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Sonhos vívidos&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;I’ve been on citalopram for nearly 8 years and have had a good experience. They took a while to kick in (the leading theory is they promote neuroplasticity in the brain which is so cool) but the only side effect I get from them is vivid dreams. They gave me my life back.&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Percepção de cores aumentada&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;The weirdest side effect yet of citalopram. My colour perception has increased. Has anyone else experienced this?&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Comprometimento cognitivo&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;While the competition is fierce, I think the republicans are slightly more out of touch than the democrats. \n\nIt seems like the audience's reactions aren't even registering with this guy. Maybe he should cut back to 12 xanax + citalopram a day.&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Embotamento afetivo&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;While the competition is fierce, I think the republicans are slightly more out of touch than the democrats. \n\nIt seems like the audience's reactions aren't even registering with this guy. Maybe he should cut back to 12 xanax + citalopram a day.&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Comprometimento cognitivo&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;A nationwide Swedish cohort study showed that the current use of antidepressants, in particular SSRIs (citalopram, sertraline, and escitalopram) and mirtazapine, was associated with faster cognitive deterioration in patients with #dementia.\n\n#depression \n\ndiscovermednews.com/impact-of-an...&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Síndrome de abstinência&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;Also I had gone cold turkey on my anxiety meds bc I had a bad experience w my previous PCP, and I ran out of refills. And boy let me tell you those fucking withdrawal symptoms are not fucking joke.\nI was lucky to have been in the lowest dose possible of citalopram, but it was Not Good&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Comprometimento cognitivo&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;SSRIs May Speed Up Cognitive Decline\nneurosciencenews.com/ssris-cognit...\n\n\&quot;Escitalopram, citalopram, &amp; sertraline were linked to the fastest decline, while mirtazapine had a milder effect\&quot;&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Pensamentos suicidas&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;Da jeg for år tilbage var på Citalopram læste jeg, at en af bivirkningerne var selvmordstanker. Så overvejer man om det er pest eller kolera.&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Comprometimento cognitivo&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;❗Seçici Serotonin Geri Alım İnhibitörleri (SSRIs), bilişsel gerilemeyi hızlandıran ilaçlar arasında.\n\n❗Escitalopram en hızlı bilişsel gerilemeyi göstermiş, ardından Citalopram ve Sertralin.\n\n❗Mirtazapin, daha az olumsuz etki yaparak diğerlerinden daha az bilişsel bozulma göstermiş.&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Comprometimento cognitivo&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;Seçici Serotonin Geri Alım İnhibitörleri (SSRIs), bilişsel gerilemeyi hızlandıran ilaçlar arasında.\n\nEscitalopram en hızlı bilişsel gerilemeyi gösterdi, ardından Citalopram ve Sertralin geldi.\n\nMirtazapin, daha az olumsuz etki yaparak diğerlerinden daha az bilişsel bozulma gösterdi.&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Comprometimento cognitivo&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;Un estudio con 18,740 pacientes con demencia señala que los antidepresivos aceleran el deterioro cognitivo. Los que provocaron un deterioro más rápido fueron escitalopram, citalopram y sertralina en comparación con aquellos que no tomaban medicación. neurosciencenews.com/ssris-cognit...&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Comprometimento cognitivo&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;Grounds for concern.\n\&quot;In this cohort study, use of antidepressants was associated with faster cognitive decline in patients with dementia, in particular SSRIs (i.e., citalopram, sertraline and escitalopram) and mirtazapine.\&quot;\nbmcmedicine.biomedcentral.com/articles/10....&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Comprometimento cognitivo&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;A study published in BMC Medicine finds that use of antidepressants, particularly selective serotonin reuptake inhibitors (citalopram, sertraline and escitalopram) and mirtazapine, is associated with faster cognitive decline in patients with dementia.\n\n#MedSky #PsychSciSky #alzsky&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Orgasmo retardado&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;My #antideptessants prevent me from cumming but without killing my sex drive. So, I'm hornier than ever with no outlet.\n\nThanks, #citalopram!&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Comprometimento cognitivo&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;The SSRI escitalopram was associated with the fastest cognitive decline, followed by the SSRIs citalopram and sertraline.\n\nMirtazapine, which has a different mechanism of action, had less negative cognitive impact than escitalopram.&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Comprometimento cognitivo&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;Key Facts\n\nFaster Cognitive Decline: Dementia patients on antidepressants showed greater cognitive deterioration over time.\nSSRI Impact: Escitalopram, citalopram, and sertraline were linked to the fastest decline, while mirtazapine had a milder effect.&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Comprometimento cognitivo&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;A new study based on data from 18,740 dementia patients suggests antidepressants may accelerate cognitive decline. Researchers found patients taking antidepressants, particularly SSRIs like escitalopram, citalopram, &amp; sertraline, experienced faster deterioration compared to those not on medication.&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Insônia&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;Still waking up at 4-5am. This is frustrating because I know my mind is becoming quieter.\n\nI’m 3 weeks into citalopram now. I know it might be a few more weeks before things settle down.&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Embotamento emocional&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;I was on citaloprqm for 10 years. It made me numb and detached. Went cold turkey (harrrd) had life coaching and now use ashwaganda- seriously I would think I’m on a lighter version of citalopram- it allows things to wash over you but not detached. 6wks on 3wks off - repeat. Worth a try?&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Síndrome de abstinência&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;I was on citaloprqm for 10 years. It made me numb and detached. Went cold turkey (harrrd) had life coaching and now use ashwaganda- seriously I would think I’m on a lighter version of citalopram- it allows things to wash over you but not detached. 6wks on 3wks off - repeat. Worth a try?&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Tristeza&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;In meinen ersten tagen auf citalopram hab ich nur geheult, mir gings elends furchtbar. \nNach so einer woche hat sich die suppe in meinem kopf so langsam entspannt und dann wars als hätte jemand nen vorhang aufgezogen.  \nDurchhalten, kann nur besser werden 👈👈&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Angústia&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;In meinen ersten tagen auf citalopram hab ich nur geheult, mir gings elends furchtbar. \nNach so einer woche hat sich die suppe in meinem kopf so langsam entspannt und dann wars als hätte jemand nen vorhang aufgezogen.  \nDurchhalten, kann nur besser werden 👈👈&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Pensamentos intrusivos&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;like I'm walking down the street to go and do my shopping, feeling fine, and all I can think about is blowing my brains out. But it's like, just an image, not really connected to an emotion (I think pre-citalopram these images would have been connected to more of a feeling? I can't remember)&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Embotamento afetivo&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;like I'm walking down the street to go and do my shopping, feeling fine, and all I can think about is blowing my brains out. But it's like, just an image, not really connected to an emotion (I think pre-citalopram these images would have been connected to more of a feeling? I can't remember)&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Pensamentos destrutivos&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;\&quot;american life expectancy lags behind the rest of the world\&quot; buddy if you take away my citalopram i'm gonna make it even lower&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Reações alérgicas&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;Friendly reminder I only found out last year: several antidepressants (Citalopram, Fluoxetene, Sertraline and others) can cause sun sensetivity. \n\nYou kinda get allergic to the sun. \n\nFor me, it's enough to sleep by an east window and feel bad the whole day.&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Ansiedade&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;My doctor made the decision to keep me on 10mg dose of citalopram after telling him that I had increased anxiety from being on it.\n\nHe said he’s planning on increasing my dose in 2 weeks time. He also told me ‘Increasing the dose doesn’t quicken recovery.’ Which I find interesting.&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Pensamentos suicidas&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;Phelps: “I had one PhD psychologist patient who took nearly a year to get from 20 mg of citalopram to 5 mg. At 3 mg using a liquid form, she said, “just put me in the hospital and stop it.” She knew she’d be having suicidal thoughts.”&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Perda da libido&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;“Addicted to antidepressants” listen here, fuckbumps, we have much better shit to be addicted to than your horny-stealing fucking citalopram and shit. We only take it so we don’t set people like you on fire&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Irritação&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;He can come pry my Citalopram from my depressed/raging/shaking/brain shocked hands. 😡&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Tremores&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;He can come pry my Citalopram from my depressed/raging/shaking/brain shocked hands. 😡&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Choque cerebral&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;He can come pry my Citalopram from my depressed/raging/shaking/brain shocked hands. 😡&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Pesadelos&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;Some people have a bad reaction to SSRIs. Others don't. A friend is among the 10% who get horrific nightmares from an SSRI called Citalopram.\n\nTapering off is difficult because Citalopram is not available in tablets below 10 mg. This needs to be addressed.&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Ansiedade&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;Apologies for my hyper vigilance the Chemical imbalance/withdrawals have given ya boi an anxiety inducing savior complex. We’ll be back after a quick pharmacy trip! #ventdoodle&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Desregulação emocional&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;citalopram is a fucking ROLLERCOASTER&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Esquecimento&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;My GP was really sympathetic. \n\nHe was like, “yeah. If this was happening to me, I’d break too. Here’s citalopram and diazepam. I’d vote for you, by the way”. \n\nAnd then after that … a summer happened. I don’t remember it. \n\nAnd then I went to work with Stonewall for a bit.&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Embotamento emocional&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;I wouldn’t be able to hold down a job without sertraline (Zoloft) right now - and I’ve found a combination with Buspirone that helps ameliorate the sexual side effects. \n\nIt took a while to find the right meds Citalopram made me a zombie but I’m not getting the same feeling from Sertraline 2/2&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Prolongamento do intervalo QT&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;Ja. Und soweit ich weiß ist das gar nicht unüblich, bzw. QT-Zeit Verlängerung ist was, was selbst so 0815 Antidepressiva wie Citalopram verursachen können, weshalb man regelmäßig zur Herzkontrolle soll(te)&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Boca seca&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;Lembrando da música:\n\nFluoxetine, fluoxetine\nParoxetine, paroxetine\nCitalopram, citalopram\nMay cause dry mouth\n\nQueria que essa última parte não tivesse tão presente agora kkkring&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Choques cerebrais&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;Thankfully been used to brain zaps after I was on 40mg citalopram for 5 years and tapered off. It stopped after I fully tapered and started the 10mg fluoxetine, but I know how jarring they feel&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Disfunção sexual&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;Years ago I was on citalopram and it basically made my penis numb and caused weight gain. Made my depression worse.&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Ganho de peso&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;Years ago I was on citalopram and it basically made my penis numb and caused weight gain. Made my depression worse.&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Pensamentos destrutivos&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;I was 8 years on Citalopram. I was unaware of the risks of suicide. I was unaware it was an SSRI like Sertraline, which I declined because of the connection to suicide risk, because I had experienced suicidal ideation. Awareness is vital for patients. \n\n www.bbc.com/news/article...&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Pensamentos destrutivos&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;My son became intensely suicidal after his GP started him on Citalopram. There was no warning that the drug might cause this (thankfully he survived) or about withdrawal syndrome.\n\nMy son had been suffering from work stress. What were they trying to treat? Why not recommend alcohol or heroin?&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Síndrome de abstinência&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;My son became intensely suicidal after his GP started him on Citalopram. There was no warning that the drug might cause this (thankfully he survived) or about withdrawal syndrome.\n\nMy son had been suffering from work stress. What were they trying to treat? Why not recommend alcohol or heroin?&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Síndrome de abstinência&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;Citalopram definitely probably maybe saved me but Man those initial side effects were gnarly. And if I didn’t take it for a few days….. also gnarly. More positives than negatives though&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Choque cerebral&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;I hated citalopram. You miss one dose and down to the minute you get the mental zaps.  I totally get the med alarm.&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Esquecimento&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;Bei mir Alk, Grass, Citalopram. Is nen weilchen her, habe große gedächtnislücken, aber ich hing wohl so an meinen Freunden&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Náusea&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;Quick update! I actually feel pretty great? The only withdraw symptoms I had were nausea &amp; irritability. I know I'm not completely out of the woods yet but hopefully that this was the extent of it. Just to give you an idea of how odd this is, I was on Citalopram for 3 yrs and Bupropion for 2ish.&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Irritabilidade&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;Quick update! I actually feel pretty great? The only withdraw symptoms I had were nausea &amp; irritability. I know I'm not completely out of the woods yet but hopefully that this was the extent of it. Just to give you an idea of how odd this is, I was on Citalopram for 3 yrs and Bupropion for 2ish.&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Dissociação&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;Ich nehm keine adhs Medis. Hab mal medikinet adult probiert vor paar Jahren aber fühlte mich mit der Kombi Citalopram + medikinet adult wie entrückt, Herzrasen, innere Unruhe. Hab dann schnell aufgegeben. Spannend das jetzt von dir zu lesen. Hatte sich dann wohl tatsächlich nicht vertragen&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Taquicardia&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;Ich nehm keine adhs Medis. Hab mal medikinet adult probiert vor paar Jahren aber fühlte mich mit der Kombi Citalopram + medikinet adult wie entrückt, Herzrasen, innere Unruhe. Hab dann schnell aufgegeben. Spannend das jetzt von dir zu lesen. Hatte sich dann wohl tatsächlich nicht vertragen&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Inquietação&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;Ich nehm keine adhs Medis. Hab mal medikinet adult probiert vor paar Jahren aber fühlte mich mit der Kombi Citalopram + medikinet adult wie entrückt, Herzrasen, innere Unruhe. Hab dann schnell aufgegeben. Spannend das jetzt von dir zu lesen. Hatte sich dann wohl tatsächlich nicht vertragen&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Embotamento emocional&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;Also ich hab schon beides genommen, Adhs/Audhs ist aber nur Verdacht aktuell. Ich hab auch das Gefühl, dass mich (Es)citalopram emotional und intellektuell halbiert (Citalopram schlimmer als Escitalopram), damit geht's mir zwar irgendwie \&quot;besser\&quot;, aber ich hasse es auch und setze immer irgendwann ab&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Comprometimento cognitivo&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;Also ich hab schon beides genommen, Adhs/Audhs ist aber nur Verdacht aktuell. Ich hab auch das Gefühl, dass mich (Es)citalopram emotional und intellektuell halbiert (Citalopram schlimmer als Escitalopram), damit geht's mir zwar irgendwie \&quot;besser\&quot;, aber ich hasse es auch und setze immer irgendwann ab&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Alterações do sono&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;it’s fun how citalopram is like “you’ll either sleep three hours or thirteen hours idk girl it depends on how I’m feeling that day 🙂‍↕️💅💁🏽‍♀️”&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Aumento do apetite&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;Citalopram, for me. God, I just *grazed* endlessly. Spent most of my money on food, it felt like. That's where that comes from. x.x&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Reação adversa&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;Fluoxetine is the one that's been the most normal on it. Sertraline beat my libido into submission. And I am never going on citalopram again it causes such a bad reaction in me &quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Choque cerebral&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;Get the \&quot;Brain shocks\&quot; too? I had those after a missed dose of citalopram (also an SSRI).&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Agitação&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;coooomeeeeee ONNN can i stop feeling the citalopram side effects now pls. idk how to describe other than MMM IT AFFECTS ME image or whatever from stupidly double dosing myself on accident bc i did Not take todays dose jic and im still Suffering the annoyance of being a bit souped up&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Síndrome de abstinência&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;This is your reminder to check that you have enough medication and reorder your prescription if you need to!! I ran out of citalopram a few days ago and while I've been waiting for my prescription to be approved, the withdrawal has been kicking my ass 😭 don't make the same mistakes I have&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Sonolência&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;Yes, I had it for a few years before GP prescribed citalopram. My exp was it's pretty mild on the old depression but made me feel sleepy. In hindisght I think I preferred it to the zombie nothingness of 'pram but YMMV of course.&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Síndrome serotoninérgica&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;Ich habe momentan nicht die Möglichkeit auf Concerta oder Kinecteen. Das Citalopram (SSRI) macht mir bei beiden einen Strich durch die Rechnung, Stichwort Serotoninsyndrom.&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Disfunção sexual&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;When I had this on citalopram i found it just easiest say say upfront to a potential playmaymate that my mads give me anorgasmia so i probably wont cum.&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Toxicidade&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;Today In 2018 The Los Angeles County Medical Examiner announced that Tom Petty had died accidentally from mixed drug toxicity, a combination of fentanyl, oxycodone, acetyl fentanyl and despropionyl fentanyl (all opioids); temazepam and alprazolam (both sedatives); and citalopram (an antidepressant).&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Ganho de peso&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;fuck yeah, citalopram. Sure, I can't lose weight or cum but at least I don't feel like a living raw nerve and the world is sandpaper&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Disfunção sexual&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;fuck yeah, citalopram. Sure, I can't lose weight or cum but at least I don't feel like a living raw nerve and the world is sandpaper&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Fadiga&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;I'm starting to suspect that there's something wrong with the Citalopram I was prescribed in December. It's not the usual brand and, since switching, I've been experiencing withdrawal symptoms (fatigue, vertigo, brain fog, executive dysfunction, GI issues). Bad batch, maybe?&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Vertigem&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;I'm starting to suspect that there's something wrong with the Citalopram I was prescribed in December. It's not the usual brand and, since switching, I've been experiencing withdrawal symptoms (fatigue, vertigo, brain fog, executive dysfunction, GI issues). Bad batch, maybe?&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Sensação de confusão mental&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;I'm starting to suspect that there's something wrong with the Citalopram I was prescribed in December. It's not the usual brand and, since switching, I've been experiencing withdrawal symptoms (fatigue, vertigo, brain fog, executive dysfunction, GI issues). Bad batch, maybe?&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Disfunção executiva&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;I'm starting to suspect that there's something wrong with the Citalopram I was prescribed in December. It's not the usual brand and, since switching, I've been experiencing withdrawal symptoms (fatigue, vertigo, brain fog, executive dysfunction, GI issues). Bad batch, maybe?&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Distúrbios gastrointestinais&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;I'm starting to suspect that there's something wrong with the Citalopram I was prescribed in December. It's not the usual brand and, since switching, I've been experiencing withdrawal symptoms (fatigue, vertigo, brain fog, executive dysfunction, GI issues). Bad batch, maybe?&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Síndrome de abstinência&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;I'm coming off my citalopram and man, withdrawal sucks.&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Vertigem&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;Yeah I forget to take that at least once a week (morning meds yay) and it’s like a hangover. Citalopram/celexa is like vertigo and THAT’s a bitch&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Pensamentos destrutivos&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;My son experienced new and almost irresistable urges to kill himself after his GP started him on Citalopram (luckily he survived).  This is a well established side-effect and is presented in a black box in the US.  Why aren't UK patients being warned?\n\nwww.theguardian.com/uk-news/2025...&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Síndrome de abstinência&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;Oh boy, I've been on Citalopram, I didn't like it either but the usage of it is unlikely to send you to suicide.\n\nSSRI withdrawal might though, from experience it leaves you fogged up with brain zaps for months on end while your mood jumps, it can't have helped.&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Sensação de confusão mental&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;Oh boy, I've been on Citalopram, I didn't like it either but the usage of it is unlikely to send you to suicide.\n\nSSRI withdrawal might though, from experience it leaves you fogged up with brain zaps for months on end while your mood jumps, it can't have helped.&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Choque cerebral&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;Oh boy, I've been on Citalopram, I didn't like it either but the usage of it is unlikely to send you to suicide.\n\nSSRI withdrawal might though, from experience it leaves you fogged up with brain zaps for months on end while your mood jumps, it can't have helped.&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Labilidade emocional&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;Oh boy, I've been on Citalopram, I didn't like it either but the usage of it is unlikely to send you to suicide.\n\nSSRI withdrawal might though, from experience it leaves you fogged up with brain zaps for months on end while your mood jumps, it can't have helped.&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Náusea&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;Passe um tempinho sem tomar o citalopram daí agora voltei a tomar e to quase me acabando de enjoo&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Aumento do risco de suicídio&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;Both sertraline and citalopram come with warnings of increased risk of suicide. I think there needs to be more awareness on tapering as suddenly quitting these meds can lead to adverse side effects very quickly. \nMillions of people rely on SSRIs to successfully manage depression/anxiety.&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Tristeza&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;Soy la única infeliz con citalopram? Bdah. Rara hasta para los ayudines.&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Sensações estranhas&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;Soy la única infeliz con citalopram? Bdah. Rara hasta para los ayudines.&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Sensações estranhas&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;Been on citalopram and now sertraline for years. It's exactly like the withdrawal symptoms. But not missed or been late with it. been having the zaps for years. Changed to sertraline 6 months ago (and increased) cos I thought it was the citalopram 😬 doc ignores as usual!&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Perda da libido&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;i have to imagine the citalopram was lowering my sex drive more than any other drug because now that it’s gone the rebound is just comical\n\nit’s like that anime where the guy trains with weights on his legs&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Bruxismo&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;Thank you! I was previously on sertraline (3 years) and then citalopram (2 months) but they both caused bruxism which meant I permanently had a headaches! My first day on venlafaxine was yesterday and it sucked bc I threw up at work from the nausea... I'm hoping it gets better and works for me!&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Dor de cabeça&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;Thank you! I was previously on sertraline (3 years) and then citalopram (2 months) but they both caused bruxism which meant I permanently had a headaches! My first day on venlafaxine was yesterday and it sucked bc I threw up at work from the nausea... I'm hoping it gets better and works for me!&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Embotamento emocional&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;Saudade de tomar remédio que não fazia sentir nada kkkkk\nQuando tomava a dose máxima de citalopram me ocorria isso, ao menos até ele parar de fazer efeito em mim&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Mal-estar&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;What idiot took their high dose citalopram before work today, I’ll give you three guesses. It’s not a vibe. The vibes are off somewhere probably in bed.&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Fadiga&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;What idiot took their high dose citalopram before work today, I’ll give you three guesses. It’s not a vibe. The vibes are off somewhere probably in bed.&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Sonolência&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;What idiot took their high dose citalopram before work today, I’ll give you three guesses. It’s not a vibe. The vibes are off somewhere probably in bed.&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Comprometimento cognitivo&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;Exposure the SSRI Citalopram causes fathead minnows to reduce predator avoidance, foraging, memory and learning, and physiological changes, especially in minnow embryos.  But Citalopram did cause an increase in social interactions among fathead minnows.&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Disfunção sexual&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;ok listen folks i need you all to know that it's certainly more difficult, but you can actually successfully jerk it on citalopram\n\nalso, it feels like \&quot;Why do antidepressants also block orgasms?\&quot; is a scientific question which could reveal deep truths about our brain chemistry if we weren't prudes&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Náusea&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;Why do I feel queasy, I wonder, having taken a citalopram on an empty stomach because I lay in bed  depressed until 1.30pm. Anyway I have made it to the gym, that will be my one achievement for the day&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Comprometimento cognitivo&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;Which ones, if you don't mind me asking? Citalopram gave me goldfish memory for a year, until I switched to Sertraline which just gave me occasionally vertigo instead.&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Embotamento emocional&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;Am I numb or is the #Citalopram kicking in?! \nEither way, I am grateful for the lessening of feelings.\n#MentallyOkay&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Pensamentos suicidas&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;Ich hab Citalopram kurzzeitig bekommen und dann akute Suizidgedanken. Zum Glück war ich nicht allein, das wurde dann abgesetzt und ich hab den Arzt gewechselt (nicht aus dem Grund) der hat mir \&quot;Duloxetin\&quot; verordnet und damit komme ich klar!&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Fadiga&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;Citalopram hatte ich als erstes Antidepressivum. Es hat mich komplett ausgeknockt. Dauernd müde, apathisch, kognitive Ausfälle, teilweise minutenlang einfach weggetreten.\nUmstellung auf Duloxetin. Keine Probleme mehr.&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Apatia&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;Citalopram hatte ich als erstes Antidepressivum. Es hat mich komplett ausgeknockt. Dauernd müde, apathisch, kognitive Ausfälle, teilweise minutenlang einfach weggetreten.\nUmstellung auf Duloxetin. Keine Probleme mehr.&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Comprometimento cognitivo&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;Citalopram hatte ich als erstes Antidepressivum. Es hat mich komplett ausgeknockt. Dauernd müde, apathisch, kognitive Ausfälle, teilweise minutenlang einfach weggetreten.\nUmstellung auf Duloxetin. Keine Probleme mehr.&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Dissociação&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;Citalopram hatte ich als erstes Antidepressivum. Es hat mich komplett ausgeknockt. Dauernd müde, apathisch, kognitive Ausfälle, teilweise minutenlang einfach weggetreten.\nUmstellung auf Duloxetin. Keine Probleme mehr.&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Síndrome serotoninérgica&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;Selbst im Wikipedia-Artikel von Citalopram wird von der gleichzeitigen Einnahme beider Medikamente im weitesten Sinne gewarnt. In dem Artikel stolperte ich heute daher über den Begriff \&quot;Serotoninsyndrom\&quot;. Und als der gute ADHSler, der ich nun Mal bin, gehe ich den nächsten Kaninchenbau. ...&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Síndrome de abstinência&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;gewählte Dosis gut. Die Schweremut wich und der Alltag konnte bewältigen werden. Der bislang einzige Versuch, das Citalopram auszuschleichen (Ende '23) misslang. Die Phase war vermutlich zu kurz und im Winter Antidepressiva abzusetzen, empfand selbst der Neurologe, bei dem ich dann wieder ...&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Insônia&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;I wake up about 3 times every night and every time think \&quot;FFS!\&quot;. I'm on Citalopram.&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Síndrome serotoninérgica&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;fought hard today. succeeded in a lot of ways. still had cardiac incidents, but i managed the nerve pain well and if it was the citalopram doing a seratonin storm to me, then that should alleviate some of the additional stress my body was under.\n\na few weeks until cardiology. more answers then.&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Tremores&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;Acho que o único que não causa tremedeira em mim é a fluvoxamina. Eu tomei citalopram por um tempo e tremia muito, e o remédio parou de funcionar, diga ai&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Apatia&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;amg tu acredita q quando tomei mirtazapina eu entrei na minha honeymoon era?? eu JURO, mas assim o citalopram me deixava apática sabe?! com  ele eu nao sentia tristeza, mas tambem nao sentia alegria nenhuma, ja o mirtazapina eu nao me sentia tao pra baixo, e eu ja conseguia ter disposicao p fazer+&quot;}]" />
          <attvalue for="3" value="72" />
          <attvalue for="4" value="0" />
          <attvalue for="5" value="0.784038 -0.482042" />
          <attvalue for="6" value="#2DCD9F" />
        </attvalues>
      </node>
      <node id="Sedação" label="Sedação">
        <attvalues>
          <attvalue for="0" value="adr" />
          <attvalue for="1" value="62" />
          <attvalue for="2" value="[{&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Citalopram&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;Von dem Opi hatte ich mehrere, dann noch drei andere Sachen, bis die in der Klinik (#HasiInKlapsi), vor zwei Jahren, festgestellt hatten, dass ich auf Citalopram sehr gut reagiere. Hatte über'n Winter eine höhere Dosis, die hatte mich aber total weggeschüsselt…&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Fluoxetina&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;Breastfeeding considerations:\n\n• Low-risk: Sertraline, nortriptyline, imipramine\n• Higher milk transfer: Fluoxetine, citalopram\n• Monitor infant for feeding/sedation issues\n• Use LactMed or trusted guidelines&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Citalopram&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;Breastfeeding considerations:\n\n• Low-risk: Sertraline, nortriptyline, imipramine\n• Higher milk transfer: Fluoxetine, citalopram\n• Monitor infant for feeding/sedation issues\n• Use LactMed or trusted guidelines&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Diazepam&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;a professora veio dar aula parecendo q tomou 3 diazepam 4 rivotril 5 paroxetina 7 sertralina ela não tá pura não&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Rivotril&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;a professora veio dar aula parecendo q tomou 3 diazepam 4 rivotril 5 paroxetina 7 sertralina ela não tá pura não&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Paroxetina&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;a professora veio dar aula parecendo q tomou 3 diazepam 4 rivotril 5 paroxetina 7 sertralina ela não tá pura não&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Sertralina&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;a professora veio dar aula parecendo q tomou 3 diazepam 4 rivotril 5 paroxetina 7 sertralina ela não tá pura não&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Paroxetina&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;minha vida só da certo quando to dopada de paroxetina&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Paroxetina&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;Quando la smisi anni fa, molto gradatamente, sentivo spesso scosse alla testa\n\nAdesso uso altre droghe legali sotto prescrizione medica perché la paroxetina era inefficace e mi rimbambiva\n\nResto ugualmente rimbambito ma solo perché sono così di mio&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Sertralina&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;mas serio, hoje foi o 4° dia de sertralina e agora sim eu senti bater. fiquei me sentindo bem dopada de manhã, meio aérea, morrendo de sono, meio flutuando no espaço. não sei explicar. bem estranho mas não ruim???? pq eu tava me sentido dopada mas tava bem, fui em festa infantil, interagi bem.&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Quetiapina&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;Grogue de quetiapina + mirtazapina e com uma colica do cacete to vendo tudi embacado com um olho so&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Mirtazapina&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;Grogue de quetiapina + mirtazapina e com uma colica do cacete to vendo tudi embacado com um olho so&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Mirtazapina&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;La sedición es habitual con la mirtazapina, pero se puede empezar a hacer tolerancia a partir de la primera semana de tratamiento. Intenta aguantar unos días, es un antidepresivo muy seguro&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Mirtazapina&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;Mirtazapina 15mg, vai dormir tanto que não vai conseguir nem levantar no outro dia 🤡&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Mirtazapina&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;Aiii, de drogas a mí la mirtazapina me ayudó muchísimo. Te deja un poco ko al principio pero fue la mejor de todas las que me dieron&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Mirtazapina&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;tomei mirtazapina por varios meses nem conseguia acordar era absurdo&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Mirtazapina&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;nossa ja tomei mirtazapina e é trash demais mal conseguia me manter acordada&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Mirtazapina&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;Se eu tomo mirtazapina eu fico MT shapeada mas durmo 18h por dia se eu nao tomo eu emagreço um kg por semana e não durmo de jeito nenhum mas Deus sabe todas as coisas&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Mirtazapina&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;Un juego para #ZxSpectrum muy elegante y también, en efecto, muy divertido. Sería algo así como Things Bounces Back de #GremlinGraphics pero \&quot;bien\&quot; y con mirtazapina (muchísimo más tranquilo, vamos).&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Mirtazapina&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;Mds a hora que a mirtazapina bater vou apagar uns 2 dias direto&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Rivotril&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;A vida é assim\nVc fica triste e toma dois comprimidos de Rivotril \n\nIsso pq já tinha tomado mirtazapina. Ou eu capoto ou eu fico acordada&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Mirtazapina&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;A vida é assim\nVc fica triste e toma dois comprimidos de Rivotril \n\nIsso pq já tinha tomado mirtazapina. Ou eu capoto ou eu fico acordada&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Mirtazapina&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;acordada, mas a que preço… parece q eu tô bebada, o mundo girando ao meu redor…mirtazapina você me paga&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Trazodona&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;as vezes um sorvetinho chapado de trazodona enquanto chora com turnover peripheral vision full album 2015 eh janta sim&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Trazodona&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;zolpidem eu nunca tomei não!! o clonazepam o médico não passou pra dormir, foi só pra crise mesmo\n\nantes eu tomava trazodona e parecia que eu entrava em coma de tanto dormir kk&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Trazodona&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;do nada o trazodona bate, só resta me entregar&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Trazodona&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;eu odiei trazodona pq é sedativo de um jeito ruim… ai nao tomava so acumulava medicação… \nmas a nortriptilina foi perfeita, me estabilizou bastante na gestação e ate agora não tenho nada ruim sobre&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Trazodona&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;Eu fico bêbado tão fácil, obrigado trazodona&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Escitalopram&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;eu o dia todo dopada de escitalopram lamotrigina trazodona rivotril nicotina cafeína e nada me ajuda nessa porra&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Lamotrigina&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;eu o dia todo dopada de escitalopram lamotrigina trazodona rivotril nicotina cafeína e nada me ajuda nessa porra&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Trazodona&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;eu o dia todo dopada de escitalopram lamotrigina trazodona rivotril nicotina cafeína e nada me ajuda nessa porra&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Rivotril&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;eu o dia todo dopada de escitalopram lamotrigina trazodona rivotril nicotina cafeína e nada me ajuda nessa porra&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Trazodona&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;400mg de trazodona deixa o sujeito igual uma folha de papel a4 colorida do senninha&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Zolpidem&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;amg tenta tomar trazodona, ele é melhor que o zolpidem e não deixa aquele sono pesado, além de não ter o perigo de viciar, foi o unico que me tirou do alprazolam e hoje eu ja mem preciso mais pra dormir&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Trazodona&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;hoje foi o primeiro dia com trazodona, e puta que pariu, parede que levei uma pedrada&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Trazodona&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;tomei trazodona ontem pela 1a vez e hoje to MOLE obg por me amolecer filho da puta só quero dormir por 13h seguidas 👍&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Trazodona&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;Chapadinha de trazodona&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Lítio&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;nossa lítio deve derrubar memo né que merda meu deus\ntalvez meu desvenlafaxina funcione pela associação também e na moral que ficar sem libido traz PAZ DE ESPÍRITO&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Amitriptilina&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;Tomei amitriptilina por engano e apaguei por várias horas&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Amitriptilina&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;queria tomar uma cartela de amitriptilina e dormir por 2 dias seguidos (e depois repetir/ não há nada que me impeça, na real&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Amitriptilina&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;então, é q eu sou meio fraca pra essas medicações, sabe?\n\nminha psiquiatra tinha receitado carbolitium junto e ele me deu intoxicação, tive de parar\n\ndepois aumentou a dosagem da amitriptilina e eu não conseguia fazer nada, parecia um zumbi, tive q voltar a dosagem menor\n\nmas vou falar com ela sim!&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Amitriptilina&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;Uma hora dessas o meu Amitriptilina já tinha me apagado. Tô começando a me arrepender de ter parado de tomar.&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Amitriptilina&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;agr eu entendi a lógica da amitriptilina, você não vai ter enxaqueca se dormir 24hrs por dia&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Amitriptilina&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;é impossível ter depressão e ansiedade tomando amitriptilina, pq não tem como vc sentir nada se vc tiver hibernando 😁😁😁&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Amitriptilina&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;amitriptilina é tipo vc n vai ficar depressivo se estiver em coma e eu amo isso&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Amitriptilina&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;Rapaz amitriptilina faz dormir um soninho bom né, mas de manhã é só a boca seca e o corpo mole \nUma batalha p acordar kkkkk&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Amitriptilina&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;Tomei uns 3 comprimidos de amitriptilina de vovó, dormi por 13hrs seguidas&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Amitriptilina&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;Já tomei quetiapina, mas não deu certo. Agora tô na venlafaxina e tem sido ótimo, tô bem estável sem perder a alma KKKKKK\nSobre a amitriptilina, no começo era um inferno, eu só queria dormir, parecia uma morta-viva, agora tá super de boas, amo 🫶🏾&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Amitriptilina&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;+ parei por conta própria e no outro dia acordei bem mais disposta\nRelatei a minha psiquiatra e ela aumentou a dosagem da amitriptilina pra 1 comprimido de 25mg (q já tomo) + metade, no entanto nesses 2 dias q comecei a tomar me senti muito mal, muito grogue, indisposta e me deixou angustiada+&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Amitriptilina&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;Se eu tomo uma amitriptilina essa hora da noite eu só acordo amanhã de tarde e infelizmente eu tenho 50 compromissos a cumprir e infelizmente vou ter que dormir sóbria&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Amitriptilina&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;vntd de tomar 5 amitriptilina p acordar so semana que vem&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Amitriptilina&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;amitriptilina faz parecer q alguém me deu uma anestesia geral e meu corpo tá acordando agora disso&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Amitriptilina&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;eu to total dopada do amitriptilina \neu to mt molenga e sem paciência&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Amitriptilina&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;Eu comecei a tratar agora com Topiramato. Eu já tratei antes com Amitriptilina, mas ele me deixava com muita ressaca. Eu sempre tive crises, mas ultimamente estou tendo dores todos os dias e se eu não tomar remédio acaba evoluíndo para crise, por isso vou fazer a profilaxia.&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Amitriptilina&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;- tomei minha amitriptilina!! firme e forte!! achei q ia me estatelar no chão entre 22hrs e 1 am e eu nem me importaria pq qlqr coisa é melhor doq vomitar de dor de cabeça de enxaqueca \n- cheguei na cs do lucas agr umas 5 am\n- persobus até alvorada 😌&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Amitriptilina&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;ontem a noite tomei amitriptilina, agora não consigo ficar de olho aberto aaa&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Amitriptilina&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;não vou tankar essa pelada a amitriptilina bateu forte&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Amitriptilina&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;Sou neuropatica e tomei Amitriptilina com clonazepan e estou na TPM. Tô me sentindo altamente chapada. Eu tô ficando lélé da cuca.&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Clonazepan&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;Sou neuropatica e tomei Amitriptilina com clonazepan e estou na TPM. Tô me sentindo altamente chapada. Eu tô ficando lélé da cuca.&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Amitriptilina&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;mds esse amitriptilina me dopou demais, qse q minha pressão vai de f tb&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Amitriptilina&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;Eu não sei o que aconteceu, mas hoje a amitriptilina bateu com força e tô chapadinha kkkkkkkkkk&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Agomelatina&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;vou tomar a cartela toda de agomelatina e passar o domingo inteiro apagada&quot;}]" />
          <attvalue for="3" value="16" />
          <attvalue for="4" value="1" />
          <attvalue for="5" value="1.712287 0.086513" />
          <attvalue for="6" value="#E9573F" />
