          <attvalue for="2" value="[{&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Sertralina&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;They reckon we're in for a warm spell of weather so it's probably a good time to remind those of Depression medications Sertaline/Citalopram/Fluoxetine/Mirtazipine or any other SRRI 💊 to keep their fluids up\n\nTo stop you from becoming dehydrated or overheating\n\nIt could save a life&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Citalopram&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;They reckon we're in for a warm spell of weather so it's probably a good time to remind those of Depression medications Sertaline/Citalopram/Fluoxetine/Mirtazipine or any other SRRI 💊 to keep their fluids up\n\nTo stop you from becoming dehydrated or overheating\n\nIt could save a life&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Fluoxetina&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;They reckon we're in for a warm spell of weather so it's probably a good time to remind those of Depression medications Sertaline/Citalopram/Fluoxetine/Mirtazipine or any other SRRI 💊 to keep their fluids up\n\nTo stop you from becoming dehydrated or overheating\n\nIt could save a life&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Mirtazapina&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;They reckon we're in for a warm spell of weather so it's probably a good time to remind those of Depression medications Sertaline/Citalopram/Fluoxetine/Mirtazipine or any other SRRI 💊 to keep their fluids up\n\nTo stop you from becoming dehydrated or overheating\n\nIt could save a life&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Sertralina&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;Alt-text because I care about people:\n\nALERT!!\n\nAnti-depressants during hot weather\n\nIf you are taking Sertraline, Citalopram, Duloxetine, Fluoxetin, Mirtazipine\nOR\nany other SNRI/SRRI you are more prone to overheating or dehydration\n\nPlease stay safe in this heat! (continued in reply)&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Citalopram&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;Alt-text because I care about people:\n\nALERT!!\n\nAnti-depressants during hot weather\n\nIf you are taking Sertraline, Citalopram, Duloxetine, Fluoxetin, Mirtazipine\nOR\nany other SNRI/SRRI you are more prone to overheating or dehydration\n\nPlease stay safe in this heat! (continued in reply)&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Duloxetina&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;Alt-text because I care about people:\n\nALERT!!\n\nAnti-depressants during hot weather\n\nIf you are taking Sertraline, Citalopram, Duloxetine, Fluoxetin, Mirtazipine\nOR\nany other SNRI/SRRI you are more prone to overheating or dehydration\n\nPlease stay safe in this heat! (continued in reply)&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Fluoxetina&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;Alt-text because I care about people:\n\nALERT!!\n\nAnti-depressants during hot weather\n\nIf you are taking Sertraline, Citalopram, Duloxetine, Fluoxetin, Mirtazipine\nOR\nany other SNRI/SRRI you are more prone to overheating or dehydration\n\nPlease stay safe in this heat! (continued in reply)&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Mirtazapina&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;Alt-text because I care about people:\n\nALERT!!\n\nAnti-depressants during hot weather\n\nIf you are taking Sertraline, Citalopram, Duloxetine, Fluoxetin, Mirtazipine\nOR\nany other SNRI/SRRI you are more prone to overheating or dehydration\n\nPlease stay safe in this heat! (continued in reply)&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Sertralina&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;If u take any of these medications please be cautious in the heat.\n\n#dehydration #heat #antidepressants #HotWeather #sertraline #citalopram #Duloxetine #fluoxetine #mirtzapine #snri #srri #hydrated #StayHydrated #medication #health&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Citalopram&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;If u take any of these medications please be cautious in the heat.\n\n#dehydration #heat #antidepressants #HotWeather #sertraline #citalopram #Duloxetine #fluoxetine #mirtzapine #snri #srri #hydrated #StayHydrated #medication #health&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Duloxetina&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;If u take any of these medications please be cautious in the heat.\n\n#dehydration #heat #antidepressants #HotWeather #sertraline #citalopram #Duloxetine #fluoxetine #mirtzapine #snri #srri #hydrated #StayHydrated #medication #health&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Fluoxetina&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;If u take any of these medications please be cautious in the heat.\n\n#dehydration #heat #antidepressants #HotWeather #sertraline #citalopram #Duloxetine #fluoxetine #mirtzapine #snri #srri #hydrated #StayHydrated #medication #health&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Mirtazapina&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;If u take any of these medications please be cautious in the heat.\n\n#dehydration #heat #antidepressants #HotWeather #sertraline #citalopram #Duloxetine #fluoxetine #mirtzapine #snri #srri #hydrated #StayHydrated #medication #health&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Amitriptilina&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;Eu parei, tentei por uma semana mas eu fui parar no pronto socorro com desidratação, a medica me proibiu de tomar e agora eu tô tentando o amitriptilina.&quot;}]" />
