      <node id="Risco de osteoporose" label="Risco de osteoporose">
        <attvalues>
          <attvalue for="0" value="adr" />
          <attvalue for="1" value="3" />
          <attvalue for="2" value="[{&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Sertralina&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;🧠 Do commonly prescribed SSRIs—sertraline, citalopram, and escitalopram—affect osteoporosis risk? 🦴 \nThis large-scale target trial emulation using real-world data set out to answer that question⬇️&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Citalopram&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;🧠 Do commonly prescribed SSRIs—sertraline, citalopram, and escitalopram—affect osteoporosis risk? 🦴 \nThis large-scale target trial emulation using real-world data set out to answer that question⬇️&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Escitalopram&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;🧠 Do commonly prescribed SSRIs—sertraline, citalopram, and escitalopram—affect osteoporosis risk? 🦴 \nThis large-scale target trial emulation using real-world data set out to answer that question⬇️&quot;}]" />
