      <node id="Pensamentos suicidas" label="Pensamentos suicidas">
        <attvalues>
          <attvalue for="0" value="adr" />
          <attvalue for="1" value="5" />
          <attvalue for="2" value="[{&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Citalopram&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;still thinking about this a lot. particularly the candour with which he talks about his suicidal thoughts, how suddenly and insanely they come into your head. also im on the same antidepressant (citalopram) and experienced a similarly miraculous change in mindset on it&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Citalopram&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;Da jeg for år tilbage var på Citalopram læste jeg, at en af bivirkningerne var selvmordstanker. Så overvejer man om det er pest eller kolera.&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Citalopram&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;Phelps: “I had one PhD psychologist patient who took nearly a year to get from 20 mg of citalopram to 5 mg. At 3 mg using a liquid form, she said, “just put me in the hospital and stop it.” She knew she’d be having suicidal thoughts.”&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Citalopram&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;Ich hab Citalopram kurzzeitig bekommen und dann akute Suizidgedanken. Zum Glück war ich nicht allein, das wurde dann abgesetzt und ich hab den Arzt gewechselt (nicht aus dem Grund) der hat mir \&quot;Duloxetin\&quot; verordnet und damit komme ich klar!&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Fluoxetina&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;Es muy loco que me dieran fluoxetina (Prozac) y que la señora que me dio la dosis del mes desde la EPS me pasó un papelito que decía algo así como: “efectos secundarios: suicidio, intento de suicidio, ideación suicida, pensamientos suicidas, etc” y tuve ganas de matarme en serio. Logré volver a la u&quot;}]" />
          <attvalue for="3" value="2" />
          <attvalue for="4" value="0" />
          <attvalue for="5" value="-0.206689 0.011113" />
          <attvalue for="6" value="#E9573F" />
        </attvalues>
      </node>
      <node id="Prolongamento do QTc" label="Prolongamento do QTc">
        <attvalues>
          <attvalue for="0" value="adr" />
          <attvalue for="1" value="1" />
          <attvalue for="2" value="[{&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Escitalopram&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;New RCT just published:  no benefit of escitalopram for agitation in #dementia but QTc prolonged.\nThis follows previous study of citalopram that showed some benefit.  Won't change practice much, as escitalopram in dementia not used often precisely because of QTc risk at effective doses.&quot;}]" />
