      <node id="Aripiprazol" label="Aripiprazol">
        <attvalues>
          <attvalue for="0" value="medication" />
          <attvalue for="1" value="2" />
          <attvalue for="2" value="[{&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Hipocalemia&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;Day 6: Most ‘severe’ drug-drug interactions relate to hypokalaemia e.g aripiprazole, citalopram or risk of renal failure e.g NSAIDs. #metolazone can also increase the concentration of lithium. Many DDIs also increase risk of hypotension e.g alcohol, other antihypertensives \n(NOT exhaustive)&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Boca seca&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;La duloxetina y el aripiprazol me tienen tomando demasiada agua xD\n\nThe duloxetine and the aripiprazole it’s making to me drink too much water&quot;}]" />
