      <node id="Xanax" label="Xanax">
        <attvalues>
          <attvalue for="0" value="medication" />
          <attvalue for="1" value="2" />
          <attvalue for="2" value="[{&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Comprometimento cognitivo&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;While the competition is fierce, I think the republicans are slightly more out of touch than the democrats. \n\nIt seems like the audience's reactions aren't even registering with this guy. Maybe he should cut back to 12 xanax + citalopram a day.&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Embotamento afetivo&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;While the competition is fierce, I think the republicans are slightly more out of touch than the democrats. \n\nIt seems like the audience's reactions aren't even registering with this guy. Maybe he should cut back to 12 xanax + citalopram a day.&quot;}]" />
