          <attvalue for="2" value="[{&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Citalopram&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;Thankfully been used to brain zaps after I was on 40mg citalopram for 5 years and tapered off. It stopped after I fully tapered and started the 10mg fluoxetine, but I know how jarring they feel&quot;}]" />
