          <attvalue for="2" value="[{&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Ganho de peso&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;Steroidal drugs or antidepressants. Lexapro (escitalopram) and most other selective serotonin reuptake inhibitors (SSRIs) are likely to cause weight gain if you take them long term.&quot;}]" />
          <attvalue for="3" value="1" />
