      <node id="Psicose" label="Psicose">
        <attvalues>
          <attvalue for="0" value="adr" />
          <attvalue for="1" value="5" />
          <attvalue for="2" value="[{&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Escitalopram&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;I definitely have my boyfriend's bronchitis, so it's a fight between my Escitalopram and Robitussin. So I'm going to go off of my Escitalopram until I get better.\n\n\&quot;Oh cool, do we get more Mania art?\&quot;\nNo, but I get to experience a psychotic breakdown and withdrawal until I'm physically better.&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Sertralina&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;a sertralina pode deixar todo mundo doido.&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Mirtazapina&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;Buenas noches, ando algo asustada y necesito consejo farmacéutico.\nMi dra. me ha recetado mirtazapina, leyendo el prospecto me he acojonado. Me dijo q me tome media pero en el prospecto pone que me voy a volver loca, con sueño, desganada, irritable y un largo etc. \nAlguien por aquí que haya tomado?&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Cetamina&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;O cara é tão nazi que matou o próprio robozinho num surto de cetamina&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Cetamina&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;O cara deve tá muito louco na cetamina nesses dias. Acho que vem mais surtada por aí.&quot;}]" />
          <attvalue for="3" value="4" />
          <attvalue for="4" value="5" />
          <attvalue for="5" value="-1.080348 0.684545" />
          <attvalue for="6" value="#E9573F" />
        </attvalues>
      </node>
      <node id="Rigidez" label="Rigidez">
        <attvalues>
          <attvalue for="0" value="adr" />
          <attvalue for="1" value="2" />
          <attvalue for="2" value="[{&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Escitalopram&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;i have twitches, clenching and limb movements non stop, but back when i was on escitalopram they defo got worse!!\n\nagain i have always have em so i cant really tell if thats related or just a coincidence but yeah&quot;}, {&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Cetamina&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;VÍDEO: mãe de Djidja Cardoso mostra filhos \&quot;travados\&quot; sob efeito de cetamina e pedindo mais\nwww.diariodocentrodomundo.com.br/essencial/vi...&quot;}]" />
